CRITICAL INSTRUCTIONS:
- Map test coverage to specific user stories and business rules from the requirements.
- Performance test scenarios must include specific numbers (concurrent users, target latency, throughput).
- Security testing must go beyond "run a scanner" — include specific attack scenarios.
- The test pyramid should be realistic — don't suggest 90% code coverage for an MVP.
- Include test data strategy — this is the #1 thing teams forget and it blocks testing.
- Regression strategy must be sustainable — an E2E suite that takes 2 hours to run will be abandoned.

